    "rawContent": [
      {
        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Wait, issue in test \"取消后不发出\": I call `controller.abort()` right after dispatch; then `poll` with timeoutS=1. The poll waits 1s and returns 204. That's fine but slow. Acceptable.\n\nAlso `assert.rejects(pending)` — pending already catches attached `.catch(()=>{})`, but assert.rejects on the same promise still works (it attaches another handler). Fine.\n\nPotential issue: in \"取消后结果被丢弃\" test, after abort, `pending` rejects. Then POST result → tombstone → applied false. Good.\n\nBut the tombstone check uses `phoneEnsureActive()` which reads process.env at call time. Good.\n\nNow, `polls` cleanup: poll requests that return immediately are fine.\n\nOne concern: the test file imports `phone-worker.ts`, which calls `registerPhoneTransport(transport)`. If other test files in the same process also import phone-worker... each test file runs in its own child process under `node --test`. Fine.\n\nNow add the test file to package.json test script list. Insert after `src/worker-shell.test.ts`."
      }
    ],
