      "stepSeq": 55,
      "reasoning": "684 pass. §一 done. Mark task complete and move to §二.\n\n§二: add route in delegation-api.ts.\n\nWhere to place: right before `app.get(\"/api/v1/tickets/:id\", ...)` at line ~700.\n\nImplementation:\n```ts\n/** 群组聚合（2026-11-10 批 26 §二）：只读，回答\"这一组副本全到齐了吗\"。 */\napp.get(\"/api/v1/tickets/groups/:groupId\", (c) => {\n  if (!fanoutGroupEnabled()) return c.json({ ok: false, error: \"not_found\" }, 404);\n  const groupId = c.req.param(\"groupId\").trim();\n  if (!groupId) return c.json({ ok: false, error: \"not_found\" }, 404);\n  const workRoot = workRootOf();\n  let canceled = new Set<string>();\n  try { canceled = storeOf().canceledTicketIds(); } catch {}\n  const group = collectGroup(workRoot, groupId, canceled);\n  if (group.total === 0) return c.json({ ok: false, error: \"not_found\" }, 404);\n  return c.json({ ok: true, ...group });\n});\n```\n\nHelper:\n```ts\nexport interface FanoutGroupSummary { groupId: string; total: number; done: number; pending: number; status: \"settled\" | \"pending\" }\n\nfunction collectFanoutGroup(workRoot: string, groupId: string, canceled: Set<string>): FanoutGroupSummary {\n  const runsDirs = [workRoot];\n  for (const entry of listManagers(workRoot)) if (entry.meta?.runs_dir) runsDirs.push(entry.meta.runs_dir);\n  let total = 0, done = 0;\n  for (const runsDir of runsDirs) {\n    const store = new Store(runsDir);\n    try {\n      for (const row of store.listTickets(500)) {\n        const ticket = readTicketJson(runsDir, row.id);\n        if (!ticket) continue;\n        if (String(ticket.idempotencyKey ?? \"\").trim() !== groupId) continue;\n        total += 1;\n        // 作废位也算终态：harness 侧不再搬这张单的结果，等待方没必要再等它。\n        if (TERMINAL_TICKET_STATUS.has(row.status) || canceled.has(row.id)) done += 1;\n      }\n    } catch {\n      // 某个库打不开就跳过：读不到不等于没有，不能把 total 判成 0 之外的东西。\n    } finally { store.close(); }\n  }\n  return { groupId, total, done, pending: total - done, status: total > 0 && done === total ? \"settled\" : \"pending\" };\n}\n```\n\nCareful: `readTicketJson` uses `path.join(runsDir, ticketId, \"ticket.json\")`. listTickets(500) — fine.\n\nNote `runsDir` for root may not exist → new Store would create sqlite? Let me check Store constructor — it may create the dir/db. In `summarizeTickets` they do `new Store(runsDir)` unconditionally on workRoot, wrapped in try. So consistent.\n\nWait — `ticket.idempotencyKey` — check the Ticket type field name. Yes used above (`ticket?.idempotencyKey`).\n\nHmm, also note that `status` in listTickets is from the sqlite `tickets` table, which may lag ticket.json? It's authoritative for status in the rest of the API. Use row.status.\n\nExported for unit test? Tests can hit HTTP; no need to export. But a pure helper is nice. Keep it internal (avoid expanding surface).\n\nRoute path concern: `/api/v1/tickets/groups/:groupId` vs existing `/api/v1/tickets/:id`. Hono's default router handles static before param. Register before `:id` anyway.\n\nAlso \"人的消息不等\" comment (4.3): add a note that human messages go via /say and don't join a group.\n\nTests (delegation-api.test.ts): add after the existing fanout test:\n1. 2 replicas 1 done → pending, total 2 done 1 pending 1.\n2. all done → settled.\n3. unknown → 404.\n4. switch off → 404.\n\nLet me write it.",
