      {
        "type": "reasoning_text",
        "text": "Probe passes: 283 checks, exit 0, including both new sections.\n\nNote: my change to make cleanup resilient was necessary because of a fixture failure; but the cleanup resilience is a good separate improvement. However — AGENTS says \"不做与本需求无关的重构\". The cleanup change was needed to surface the real error, and it's a small robustness fix. I'll mention it in the change record.\n\nNow docs:\n1. 接口文档 §2.9: add group endpoint row + subsection.\n2. §5: pairing fingerprint + key-change.\n3. §6: env vars PHONE_ENSURE_ACTIVE, PAIR_DEVICE_FINGERPRINT. Also document the response shape of redeem.\n4. 变更记录 file.\n\nLet me write the 接口文档 edits.\n\n§2.9 table: add row after `GET /api/v1/tickets/:id`:\n| `GET /api/v1/tickets/groups/:groupId` | 多副本聚合（2026-11-10 批 26 §二）：→ `{ok, groupId, total, done, pending, status}`；`status` 仅当全部终态为 `settled`，否则 `pending`；组不存在 / `DELEGATION_FANOUT_GROUP=false` → `404 {\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"not_found\"}` |\n\nAnd a paragraph after the groupId paragraph.\n\n§5 table: update redeem row and devices row:\n| `POST /api/v1/pair/redeem` | 免 | `{code, deviceName}` → `{deviceToken, deviceId, fingerprint?, name, version}`（2026-11-10 批 26 §四 加 `deviceId` / `fingerprint`）；错误见下表 |\n| `GET /api/v1/pair/devices` | 需 | → `{devices:[{id,name,createdAt,lastSeenAt?,revokedAt?,fingerprint?,keyChanged?,keyChangedAt?}]}`（**不含 tokenHash**） |\n\nNote: the doc currently says devices → array, but actual is `{devices:[...]}`. That's a doc discrepancy — fix it (it's a documented contract bug). Also add fingerprint explanation + fail-closed.\n\n§6 env: add two rows near related ones. PHONE_ENSURE_ACTIVE near CHANCELLOR/delegation vars; PAIR_DEVICE_FINGERPRINT near pairing vars (there are none in §6 besides PAIRING_STORE_PATH? Not listed). I'll add both after DELEGATION_FANOUT_GROUP line (2120).\n\nAlso update the `groupId` paragraph to mention the aggregation endpoint (\"现在就等最后一个副本：查组聚合\").\n\nChange record content: sections with what/why/verification/boundaries + the missing task book note.\n\nLet me do the doc edits."
